---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';
import TransitCalculator from '../components/TransitCalculator.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Burgas Airport Transfers (BOJ) & Transit | Burgas 2027 Guide" 
  description="How to get to Burgas 2027. Ultimate guide to Burgas airport transfers, Istanbul border crossing, and getting to the Arena."
>
  <div class="container page-content">
    <h1 class="text-gradient">Transit & Logistics Playbook</h1>
    <p class="lead">Don't let logistics ruin your Eurovision experience. Here is the ultimate guide to Burgas airport transfers and getting around the coast.</p>

    <div class="content-grid">
      <div class="main-column">
        <TransitCalculator />

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4">
          <h2>✈️ Flying into Burgas (BOJ)</h2>
          <p>Burgas Airport is only 10 km from the city center. During the event week, expect high demand for official taxis.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Public Bus:</strong> Line No. 15 runs every 20-30 minutes. Costs ~1.50 BGN (cash only in some cases, so carry small change).</li>
            <li><strong>Official Taxi:</strong> Eko Taxi is the official airport partner.</li>
            <li><strong>Private Transfer:</strong> Highly recommended for groups arriving late.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="varna-airport">
          <h2>🌊 How to get from Varna Airport to Arena Burgas</h2>
          <p>Varna (VAR) is the second closest airport. The drive takes about 2 hours along the scenic coastal road.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="glass-panel mb-4" id="istanbul-transit">
          <h2>🇹🇷 The Istanbul Route (IST to Burgas)</h2>
          <p>Many international fans will fly into Istanbul (IST) due to better global flight connections. If you are looking for a <strong>bus from istanbul new airport to burgas timetable</strong>, note that direct public buses are limited and often sell out months in advance. The drive takes about 4-5 hours depending on the Dereköy/Malko Tarnovo border crossing.</p>
          <div class="insider-note">
            <strong>Insider Note:</strong> We are organizing dedicated VIP minivans (Mercedes V-Class) directly from IST to Burgas. 
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="glass-panel sticky-box">
          <h3>Book Your Transfer</h3>
          <p>Secure your ride from the airport in advance to avoid surge pricing.</p>
          <AffiliateButton text="Book via KiwiTaxi" href="#" provider="kiwitaxi" />
          
          <hr style="margin: 24px 0; border-color: var(--glass-border);" />
          
          <h3>Rent a Car</h3>
          <p>Staying in Sozopol or Pomorie? A rental car might be cheaper than daily taxis.</p>
          <AffiliateButton text="Compare Cars" href="#" provider="discovercars" />
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content {
    padding: 64px 24px;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .mb-4 {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  h2 {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .insider-note {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-amber);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .sticky-box {
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .sticky-box h3 {
    color: var(--accent-magenta);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .content-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
